sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Integration / Worker / Tests
    participant Facade as program.rs thin facade
    participant Pipeline as Single check() / check_form() pipeline
    participant Walker as Shared Expr walker helpers
    participant Traits as traits.rs front-end
    participant ImplFinish as Shared impl-method finalizer
    participant Index as Lookup facade over module tables
    participant EntryFactory as Def entry constructors / builders
    participant Modules as DashMap<ModuleFullPath, SymbolTable>

    Caller->>Facade: typecheck request
    Facade->>Pipeline: check() / check_form() only
    Pipeline->>Index: type/trait/impl lookups via one facade
    Index->>Modules: centralized scans / cached views

    loop each form / body pass
        Pipeline->>Walker: walk expr tree for annotation / deferred resolution / call collection
        Walker-->>Pipeline: per-pass callbacks only
    end

    alt Standard impl method
        Pipeline->>Traits: resolve method-specific types
        Traits->>ImplFinish: finalize checked impl method
    else HKT impl method
        Pipeline->>Traits: resolve HKT-specific types
        Traits->>ImplFinish: finalize checked impl method
    end

    ImplFinish->>Walker: annotate AST using shared traversal
    ImplFinish->>EntryFactory: build/update Def entry through helpers
    EntryFactory->>Modules: insert/update canonical symbol-table entry

    Note over Facade,Pipeline: Deprecated check_program()/check_repl_input() removed or reduced to thin wrappers
    Note over Walker,EntryFactory: New Expr variants and Def-entry fields updated in one place
